OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced to 10 years for
OL,4,Amanslaughter of brother's girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year old man has been sentenced to
OL,7,F12 years in jail with two years
OL,8,Fsuspended for the manslaughter of his
OL,9,Fbrother's girlfriend.
OL,11,FThe Central Criminal Court was told
OL,12,Fthat Joseph Butler, of the Belfry,
OL,13,FBridewell Lane, Mallow, County Cork,
OL,14,Fstabbed Paula Canty with a kitchen
OL,15,Fknife and left her to die after an
OL,16,Fargument between the two at her
OL,17,Fapartment in Mallow in January 2025.
OL,19,FMs Canty was a 31-year-old
OL,20,Fmother-of-two.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
