OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced to 10 years for
OL,4,Amanslaughter of brother's girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe spent the night of 2 January last
OL,7,Fyear at her apartment in Mallow,
OL,8,Fdrinking with her boyfriend, his
OL,9,Fbrother and another woman when an
OL,10,Fargument broke out between Butler and
OL,11,FMs Canty.
